Output docs/assets/rust-imager-demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 16
Set Margin 20
Set MarginFill "#111827"
Set WindowBar ColorfulRight
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 20

Type@1ms "rm -rf /tmp/rust-imager-readme-demo && mkdir -p /tmp/rust-imager-readme-demo && docker run --rm -it --privileged -v /tmp/rust-imager-readme-demo:/output rust-imager-demo:0.2.7-arm64-ubuntu-24.04"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "Virtual eMMC Reader"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "3"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Enter
Sleep 7s
